5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify staffing capacity before discussing any new routes. Who is checking the roster books?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Crowding complaints are loud, but I want to know where the time actually goes. I'm checking the journey audits.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’m reviewing the capital ledger balances. Headline totals are meaningless if we don’t know what we’re already committed to paying later.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,I am reviewing the two pilots from eight years ago. We must learn from past attempts before repeating them.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am checking the joint operators' committee minutes. I need to know who else must agree before we promise anything.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, your ledger check is vital. I am also reviewing the crew establishment and maintenance contract to see if we have the hands to run this.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, if the rosters are empty, the journey audits are just theory. I’m also checking the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, valid point. I’m also checking the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates to see where the hidden costs actually sit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, your committee check is wise. I am also reviewing the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme to see what actually stuck.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, your records check is prudent. I am also reviewing the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells to see what the ground might hide.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, your focus on past failures is wise. I am also reviewing the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells to understand the hidden risks.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, checking the shells is smart, but I need to know if the crowds are real. I’m also checking the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, fees are a distraction if the money isn't there. I am also checking the joint operators' committee minutes to see who else holds the purse strings.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, the purse strings matter, but so does the ground. I am also checking the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells to see what the earth hides.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, the purse strings are tight, but the ground is tighter. I am also checking the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme to see what actually stuck.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I am also reviewing the roster books for the late-turn pool. We must confirm the late shifts are actually staffed before promising anything.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I am also reviewing the roster books for the late-turn pool. If the late shifts are empty, the extension is just a fantasy.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, @Takumi, the late pool is critical. I am also reviewing the crew establishment and maintenance contract to see if we have the hands to run this.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, the hands are essential, but the history is the map. I am also reviewing the joint operators' committee minutes to see who else must agree.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
