35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: The ledger shows a ring-fenced construction balance, but the operating subsidy and technology line were trimmed again.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: The pilots from eight years ago are instructive. The late-evening timetable met its cost-recovery target, and the ferry trial closed without technical faults.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,- **Jonathan**: The committee minutes reveal the ferry and rail back offices never agreed on common passenger data terms.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: The late-turn pool has thinned yearly, and overtime now covers both final departures and overnight works.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: @Asuka, that confirms my fear. The ring-fenced balance is a trap; the operating subsidy is already bleeding.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: @Benjamin, the data terms are a dead end. I am also checking the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Benjamin, the thinning pool confirms the rosters are empty. We cannot promise new services without the hands to run them.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Takumi,,#### Turn 3 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: @Asuka, precisely. We are borrowing from the future to pay for the present. The ledger is bleeding.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: @Benjamin, the ledger bleeds, but the pilots prove the late service can sustain itself. We must not let fear of the present kill a proven future.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, the pilots prove the service works, but the minutes prove the partners won’t share data. We cannot build on a broken foundation.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, the pilot proves demand, not capacity. My rosters show the late pool is already stretched thin. We cannot extend hours without bodies.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Asuka"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Asuka**: @Servas, the pilot proves demand, not capacity. My rosters show the late pool is already stretched thin. We cannot extend hours without bodies.""}]}"
51,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"- **Takumi**: @Asuka, the rosters are empty, but the audits show the time is lost in waiting, not paying. We must fix the connections first.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: @Takumi, fixing connections is cheap, but the ledger shows we lack the operating subsidy to even maintain current standards.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, the ledger is tight, but the pilots prove the late service can sustain itself. We must not let fear of the present kill a proven future.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, the ledger is tight, but the ground is tighter. Bidders now price heavy contingency into the pre-war shells after recent voids.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
